al;font-weight:normal;\">北京、上海、成都、广州依旧为旅客首选，</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">昆明</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">、</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">西安、</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">乌鲁木齐、青岛、厦门、沈阳、三亚、济南、大连</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">等城市热度持续攀升，成为错峰出游的热门选择。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">机票价格方面，</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">民航官方直销平台显示，五一假期后多条航线机票价格回落，</span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">5月中旬为价格“洼地”。北京—成都、北京—广州、北京—上海、广州—昆明、广州—海口等热门航线均有1-2</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">折机票。上海</span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">-三亚、上海-海口、上海-青岛等航线，更是有低至 200 元左右机票在售。旅客通过“AI预订”购买机票，部分航班还能再减10-80元，订票价格更加优惠。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">随着国际航线持续恢复，出境游也成为错峰游的新选择。航旅纵横大数据显示，截至</span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">5月7日，5月8日-5月31日的出入境航线机票预订量超402万张，同比增长约4%。5月8日至31日，中国境内往返欧洲的计划航班量同比增长约15%。出境热门目的地为：首尔、曼谷、中国香港、中国台北、新加坡、吉隆坡、莫斯科、伦敦、悉尼、河内。</span></font></span></p><p><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">航旅纵横民航官方直销平台运营负责人李昊颖表示，</span></font><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">5月8日至5月31日通常是全年性价比较高的出游时段之一，机票、酒店价格均处于低位，景区客流较少，气候宜人，非常适合年假党、银发族和自由职业者出行。最后提醒旅客，节后机票价格可能因供需变化出现小幅波动。建议旅客购票时优先选择标注“买贵退”标识的机票，若在出票后24小时之内发现同一航班的机票更便宜，</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">即可</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">购买便宜的机票，并</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">通过</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">航旅纵横</span></font></span><span><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">APP内专属</span></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">服务</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">页面提交退</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">旧</span></font></span><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.034em;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;\">票申请。</span></font></span></p><section style=\"text-align: center;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100037308\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/phC3FYLrEUuFuiasVYXugKuuyibAMPQjuibcgic26KkhDqRmfywGqeyvR1xMhX6mibcoEGqWFsdIyibmYuOpPpzqIkhVLB3bb6apBQTH9ZxiatJMTw/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" type=\"block\"></section><p><span><font face=\"宋体\"><span leaf=\"\" style=\"color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9);font-size:17px;font-family:\"mp-quote\", \"PingFang SC\", system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft 